WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:11.749
When Dad comes home we all line up and greet him.

2
00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:16.952
He simply loves that.

3
00:00:16.953 --> 00:00:18.714
Bada: Hi, Dad.

4
00:00:18.715 --> 00:00:21.038
Hana: Hello, Daddy.

5
00:00:21.039 --> 00:00:23.456
Mom: Hi, honey. How was work?

6
00:00:23.457 --> 00:00:28.805
Dad: Hi, everyone. I've been busy today.

7
00:00:28.806 --> 00:00:31.643
Bada: Dad, I have a message for you.

8
00:00:31.644 --> 00:00:32.840
Here you go.

9
00:00:32.841 --> 00:00:35.815
Dad: Let me see. Hmm.

10
00:00:35.816 --> 00:00:41.161
Who is this? M K?

11
00:00:41.162 --> 00:00:44.174
Bada: That's Mr. Kim and his phone number.

12
00:00:44.175 --> 00:00:46.523
Dad: I see. Thank you, Bada.

13
00:00:46.524 --> 00:00:48.225
You did a good job.

14
00:00:48.226 --> 00:00:54.832
Bada: Really? From now on, I will take all the messages.

15
00:00:54.833 --> 00:00:58.149
Hana: Wow, Bada. Can you spell?

16
00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:01.924
Bada: I know my ABCs. That's enough.

17
00:01:01.925 --> 00:01:07.559
Mom: He's right.

18
00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:10.356
We all had to laugh at Bada.

19
00:01:10.357 --> 00:01:16.128
It looks like nothing can stop him now!
